   ButtonBox["CliqueFacetAutomorphismGroupOrder",
    BaseStyle->"Link",
    ButtonData->"paclet:ECGrav/ref/CliqueFacetAutomorphismGroupOrder"], "[", 
   StyleBox["facetsLst_List", "TI"], "]"}]], "InlineFormula",ExpressionUUID->
  "a80bd1a0-99a7-814c-ac17-912d5ce91711"],
 "\[LineSeparator]returns the facet automorphism group order of the clique \
complex given as a list ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  StyleBox["facetsLst", "TI"]], "InlineFormula",ExpressionUUID->
  "597d2ddb-bcce-744c-8f1c-e0cc76a9ab17"],
 " of \tmaximal cliques. It does not check whether or not the input complex \
is a clique complex."
}], "Usage",
